    "note": "1st Sub. (Buff) H.B. 271, 02-25-20, with House Floor Amendments 2-28-2020 (marked in print); Senate or later amendments are not in the text read. Floor amendments also added a homeless-shelter section (new 53-5a-103.5) letting local governments prohibit firearms in shelters, shown in bracketed margin text, not quoted. Section 3 waives governmental immunity for suits under the new Part 22."
